# Build context of every image built from the repository root
# (deploy/community/docker-compose.build.yml, context `../..`). mcp-service reads
# its own apps/mcp-service/Dockerfile.dockerignore instead, and the dashboard builds
# from its own directory.
#
# node_modules: an installed tree (after `pnpm install` or a test run) would be
# copied into the build, and pnpm then stops on « The modules directory ... will
# be removed and reinstalled from scratch. Proceed? (Y/n) », which no build
# answers. Every image installs its own dependencies.
**/node_modules
# Every Dockerfile builds its dist, and the shared libs' dist, in its builder stage.
**/dist
**/coverage
.git
# No Dockerfile copies an environment file: configuration comes at runtime.
**/.env*
